        "slc_3c92296c3e12b41ac08a24839898e3343a15592bd9f28d00768a63195fd463a7"
      ],
      "text": "When HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY is set, web_fetch's local address checks can be bypassed because the proxy decides the actual destination; leaving the variables unset keeps the checks enforced end to end."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_03542652bab2197f1e2d62c324e18afe732a4f8ce64d9835c99b5823382ebc25",
